# iCloud conflict copies. This repo lives in iCloud Drive, which resolves a
# sync collision by writing "name 2.ext" beside the original. Nineteen of them
# appeared during one editing session, including a duplicate of
# public/brand/signature-mark@2x.png — and because public/ is copied verbatim
# into out/, they would have been deployed to production as junk urls.
# scripts/deploy.sh refuses to build while any are present.
*\ 2.*
*\ 3.*
